      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka walondelumu hachila aka chayilaŋawu anyanta kumajita, Yowabi hakutwala njita yakabimba, hakupupa ituŋa dawanyana kaAmoni, hakushika kuRaba, hakuwukuchika. Ilaŋa Davidi washakamini kuYerusalema. Yowabi hakutapa Raba, hakuwimika mushindu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi hakumufumisha mwanta wawu chibapula chindi kunamutu windi, kutala pezuyachu yashika muntalenta yawuru, chadiŋi natumalola twalema. Hiyakuchisnakunamutu waDavidi. Hakwidisha yuma yapupiluwu mumukalayayivulu nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwidishamu antu adiŋumu, hakuyiketula nampokujamazewu, nayikuŋu yamajimaji, niyizembi. Dimu mwakoŋeliyi Davidi nyikala yawanyana kaAmoni yejima. Davidi nawantu ejima hiyakufunta kuYerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulondela henohu kuGezeri kwasaŋu mukili njita nawaFwilistinu; henohu mukwaHusha Sibekayi, hakujaha Sipayi wahadi anyana kanoluluntu lwasweja kutaluka; afwomoka nikufwomoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwelili nawa cheŋi njita nawaFwilistinu; mwana kaYayiri Elihanani, hakujaha Lahimi mana kwaGoliyati wakuGati wadiŋi neyopa dikweti mulunda wudi neyi chipamba chamu kwakutuŋa mahina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KuGati kwelili cheŋi njita, kwadiŋi iyala wasweja kutaluka, wukweti nyinu makumi ayedi nayiwana nikumakasani kunyendu, kuchikasa yitanu nawumu kumwendu nawa yitanu nawumu, niyena nawa wadiŋi mwana kalwenolu luntu lwasweja kutaluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chahosheliyi mazu akudiwula aIsarela, Jonatani mwana kaShimeya mana kwa-Davidi hakumujaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa adiŋi anyana kalwenolu luntu lwaswejakutaluka, avwalikilili kuGati; afwilili kuchikasa chaDavidi nikumakasa awambuŋindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
